      <stdin>:109: storage size of `g_original_os_actions' isn't known
      Return code 12 from GCC of INTERRUP
   'GCC RXSPAWN  C' SourceDisk '( CMS PARM' ParmFn 'CSECT'
      In file included from <stdin>:65:
