      Return code 12 from GCC of RXSPAWN
   */
   'GCC EXITFUNC C' SourceDisk '( CMS PARM' ParmFn 'CSECT'
   /* TODO
   'GCC RXPAFUNC C' SourceDisk '( CMS PARM' ParmFn 'CSECT'
      In file included from <stdin>:30:
      rxvmvars.h: In function `_FN0356':
      rxvmvars.h:1229: Internal compiler error in ?, at <stdin>:902
      Please submit a full bug report,
      with preprocessed source if appropriate.
      See <URL:http://gcc.gnu.org/bugs.html> for instructions.
      Return code 12 from GCC of RXPAFUNC
   'GCC RXVMRUN  C' SourceDisk '( CMS PARM' ParmFn 'CSECT'
      In file included from <stdin>:30:
      rxvmvars.h: In function `_FN0362':
      rxvmvars.h:1547: Internal compiler error in ?, at <stdin>:902
      Please submit a full bug report,
      with preprocessed source if appropriate.
      See <URL:http://gcc.gnu.org/bugs.html> for instructions.
      Return code 12 from GCC of RXVMRUN
   */

